<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore to cooperate on APL investigation.</title>
<headline>Singapore to cooperate on APL investigation.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Singapore government will cooperate with the United States Securities and Exchange Commission (SEC) in investigating alleged insider trading involving APL Ltd shares, the Monetary Authority of Singapore (MAS) said on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
